                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "Comfortable environment, good service, and delicious food.\n\nHighly recommend the dry pot chicken, taro porridge, and a variety of side dishes!\n\nOverall, highly recommended.\n\nThe only drawback is the slow food service.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "環境舒服，服務良好，餐點美味\n推薦乾鍋雞、芋頭粥、多元化小菜！\n整體非常推薦，\n唯一美中不足就是出餐速度",
