                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJ5dVK6NurQjQRzVlfiCLENRA/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xCV2VHTkpOekJwTkdoeE1uRndkREkwZWtoTFIxRRAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "10 months ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "This family-run restaurant is very comfortable and conveniently located, tucked away in an alley. The mushroom and chicken soup is delicious and surprisingly unique – it\u0027s all chicken meat with no bones! The kimchi and beef is tasty, and the steamed cod is good. If you live nearby, you\u0027d definitely come back – no need to cook after school for your kids!",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "家庭式小飯館，吃起來很舒服，位置也比較舒適，藏在巷子裏，香菇雞湯很好喝且神奇，雞湯只有雞肉沒有骨頭，泡菜牛肉好吃，蒸扁鱈不錯，住附近會再來這樣小孩放學免煮飯",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
                        "authorAttribution":  {
                                                  "displayName":  "lo shine",
