                                              },
                        "publishTime":  "2025-08-06T10:58:34.880231817Z",
                        "flagContentUri":  "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xCV2VHTkpOekJwTkdoeE1uRndkREkwZWtoTFIxRRAB\u0026d=17924085\u0026t=1",
                        "googleMapsUri":  "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xCV2VHTkpOekJwTkdoeE1uRndkREkwZWtoTFIxRRAB!2m1!1s0x3442abdbe84ad5e5:0x1035c422885f59cd"
                    },
                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJ5dVK6NurQjQRzVlfiCLENRA/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pCWGNXZGlZMDFvZGxoQ2VqaGlka3d4WkhWTmIwRRAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "9 months ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "Hidden in a residential area, this family-style restaurant is truly homey in name only. The space is quiet and comfortable, with soft, non-glaring lighting. The food is served in a buffet style – you take what you want and pay only. Rice and porridge are available on-site, and main dishes are made to order for NT$80 per plate. Several side dishes are served on a single plate for NT$40. There are also several drinks available, including ice cream! The dining environment is really nice, perfect for a quiet meal alone. In the bustling city of Taipei, for those struggling to make a living, it\u0027s nice to have a place like this to relax and enjoy a warm, home-cooked meal.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "隱藏在住宅區裡的家庭式餐廳，是名義上真的家庭式的那種，寧靜舒服的空間，燈光柔和不刺眼。餐點就是類自助式的，拿多少付多少。現場有飯有粥可選擇，主食都是現點現做，一盤80元，小菜是好幾種放在一個碟子裡40元。飲料好幾種，還有冰淇淋！用餐環境真的很不錯，適合一個人待著靜靜用餐，在這人群匆匆的台北市，北漂的日子裏還有這種地方待一下，靜下心來好好吃一頓熱騰騰的家常飯，挺不錯的",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
                        "authorAttribution":  {
                                                  "displayName":  "ai vien Qiong",
                                                  "uri":  "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101035958563987330501/reviews",
                                                  "photoUri":  "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVY81GmcetYX6GJ28k0bWHvkDrDn4-Ka_ahhUxKFqiLnrxGnC0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2"
                                              },
                        "publishTime":  "2025-08-15T10:39:28.779422294Z",
                        "flagContentUri":  "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pCWGNXZGlZMDFvZGxoQ2VqaGlka3d4WkhWTmIwRRAB\u0026d=17924085\u0026t=1",
                        "googleMapsUri":  "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pCWGNXZGlZMDFvZGxoQ2VqaGlka3d4WkhWTmIwRRAB!2m1!1s0x3442abdbe84ad5e5:0x1035c422885f59cd"
                    },
                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJ5dVK6NurQjQRzVlfiCLENRA/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21SR1VrVXRZMU5OZG5KcVVFUm9WMHB6U1dOSVMxRRAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "3 months ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "A truly unique dining experience. The owner mentioned that school hadn\u0027t started yet, and we happened to be the first table there.\n\nWe ordered the recommended dry-fried chicken. The chicken, green beans, and potatoes all had distinct yet harmonious flavors. The side dishes were a hot platter; we didn\u0027t specifically choose any, but everything was delicious. The chicken soup had more meat than I expected.\n\nThere was a self-service beverage bar inside, including a coffee machine, brewed cassia seeds, and soy milk (I don\u0027t know how sweet it was).\n\nA rather unique experience; worth checking out. Most importantly, it was delicious. Before leaving, we even took a side dish and a main course home for tomorrow\u0027s lunchbox.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "非常特別的用餐體驗，當天老闆提到尚未開學，我們剛好第一桌。\n點了大家推薦的乾烹雞，四季豆雞肉跟馬鈴薯味道都很特別，卻又有一致性；小菜是熱的拼盤我們沒有特別選，每一樣都好吃；雞湯的肉量也比想像中多。\n店內有飲料吧自取，包含咖啡機、煮好的決明子、不知道甜度的豆漿等等。\n蠻特別的經驗，可以來體驗看看。重點是好吃，離開前還外帶一份小菜跟主菜當明天的便當。",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
                        "authorAttribution":  {
                                                  "displayName":  "Hsun Hung",
                                                  "uri":  "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100204708329265678276/reviews",
                                                  "photoUri":  "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWkGIbNTob8Econ5vjiuKMp0FzdK3qfK1SLGdQpzRFFTMpcqQA_Qg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4"
                                              },
                        "publishTime":  "2026-02-28T01:52:26.468836214Z",
                        "flagContentUri":  "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21SR1VrVXRZMU5OZG5KcVVFUm9WMHB6U1dOSVMxRRAB\u0026d=17924085\u0026t=1",
                        "googleMapsUri":  "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21SR1VrVXRZMU5OZG5KcVVFUm9WMHB6U1dOSVMxRRAB!2m1!1s0x3442abdbe84ad5e5:0x1035c422885f59cd"
                    },
                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJ5dVK6NurQjQRzVlfiCLENRA/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xkTk5HZ3RNSEIyVDBobGRFMVlVa3hsY1dZeGVWRRAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "9 months ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "Everything is à la carte, pay only for what you take.\nTaro porridge $40\nSide dishes $40\nDry pot chicken $80\nThe owner is very polite. Due to staff shortages, the main dishes are freshly cooked and require a short wait.\nThe taro porridge itself is salty and has a broth flavor. Besides the soft taro puree and rice porridge, there are also chunks of taro.\nThe side dishes each have their own flavor, including cold plum-dressed, braised, and boiled dishes.\nThe dry pot chicken is mildly spicy and the seasoning is just right. The lotus root slices and potatoes are fried first to better coat the seasoning.\nThe ambiance is not too crowded when I went just after opening, but there are only three four-person tables. It might be too cramped if you have a larger group.\nAlso, fruit flies are inevitable in the restaurant industry during the summer.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "全部單點，拿多少付多少\n芋頭粥$40\n小菜$40\n乾鍋雞$80\n老闆很客氣，人手不足，主食現炒需要稍作等待\n芋頭粥本身有鹹，有高湯的味道，除了燉得軟爛的芋頭泥跟米粥，也有塊狀的芋頭\n小菜各有各的味道，有涼拌梅汁味的，也有滷味跟水煮\n乾鍋雞微辣，調味剛好，藕片跟馬鈴薯先煎炸後更好包覆調味\n環境上在剛開門時過去，空間不會太過擁擠，但四人桌只有三桌，如果人數較多要用餐應該會太擠\n另外夏天餐飲業難免有果蠅。",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
